                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.30.0"&gt;3.30.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Add support for Azure Event Hubs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Optimization] Add support for MSTest 4.x.x&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[OpenTelemetry] OTLP Logs API Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Continuous Profiler] Performance improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tracer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Add Azure Event Hubs instrumentation  (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3487185668" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7620" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7620/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7620"&gt;#7620&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[OTEL] OTLP Logs API Support (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3534358840" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7680" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7680/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7680"&gt;#7680&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Add new process tags (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3513865879" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7651" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7651/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7651"&gt;#7651&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;small follow up on process tags (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3571375303" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7743" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7743/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7743"&gt;#7743&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Removing Forgiven Nulls (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3571877513" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7745" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7745/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7745"&gt;#7745&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add fix for whitespace in exporter settings and metrics URL (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3575870599" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7747" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7747/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7747"&gt;#7747&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix ad-hoc use of &lt;code&gt;TracerSettings&lt;/code&gt; to use &lt;code&gt;MutableSettings&lt;/code&gt; where appropriate (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3441277883" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7543" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7543/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7543"&gt;#7543&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix calls to &lt;code&gt;IsIntegrationEnabled()&lt;/code&gt;,  &lt;code&gt;IsErrorStatusCode()&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;GetIntegrationAnalyticsSampleRate()&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3441300815" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7544" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7544/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7544"&gt;#7544&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enforce that you can't update exporter settings to point to UDS on Windows (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3561638262" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7721" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7721/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7721"&gt;#7721&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;CI Visibility&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Optimization] MsTest support updates (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3521112865" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7663" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7663/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7663"&gt;#7663&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Continuous Profiler&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Perf improvements + cleanup (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3540796634" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7696" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7696/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7696"&gt;#7696&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[crashtracker] Fix native and managed callstacks merge (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3547062801" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7703" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7703/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7703"&gt;#7703&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Don't take tracer stable config notification when kill switch detected (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3549282194" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7705" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7705/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7705"&gt;#7705&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
