&lt;li&gt;Protect against &lt;code&gt;claimsPrincipal&lt;/code&gt; being &lt;code&gt;null&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3561313731" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7719" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7719/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7719"&gt;#7719&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
